WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:03.002
Backing Pierce is the key
to our proxy defense.

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.938
They're inquiring
about your moral character,

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.038
<i> hence this weekend.</i>

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:09.342
My worry is that Kendall
may come across as too cool

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:10.342
and likable.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.813
Welcome to Turnhaven,
our city on the hill.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.616
Wow, I like this staff.
Why couldn't this staff be Dad?

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:21.287
Any thought given to whom
you might handover the keys?

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.189
Just whisper it in my ear.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:29.229
Watching you people melt down
is the most satisfying activity.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:30.630
We aim to please.

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:32.265
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

